{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  KC Theory — About Section
  ============================================================
  File        : sections/kc-about.liquid
  Description : Left-aligned founder story with cinematic
                parallax background, gold blockquote, and
                scroll-reveal animations.
  Assets      : kc-about-bg.jpg (upload to theme assets)
  ============================================================
{% endcomment %}

<section
  id="about"
  style="
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000e1c;
  "
>

  {%- comment -%} ── Parallax Background ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <div
    class="kc-parallax-bg"
    style="
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url('{{ section.settings.bg_image | default: 'kc-about-bg.jpg' | asset_url }}');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center 40%;
      opacity: 0.35;
    "
  ></div>

  {%- comment -%} ── Gradient Overlay ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <div style="
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(0,14,28,0.9)  0%,
      rgba(0,14,28,0.6)  30%,
      rgba(0,14,28,0.7)  70%,
      rgba(0,14,28,0.95) 100%
    );
  "></div>

  {%- comment -%} ── Fog Glow ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <div style="
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 60%, rgba(212,168,83,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  "></div>

  {%- comment -%} ── Section Number Watermark ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kc-section-num" style="top: -2rem; left: -1rem;">01</div>

  {%- comment -%} ── Content ── {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kc-container" style="
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    padding-top: 7rem;
    padding-bottom: 7rem;
  ">
    <div style="max-width: 760px;">

      {%- comment -%} Eyebrow {%- endcomment -%}
      <span class="kc-eyebrow kc-reveal" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        {{ section.settings.eyebrow | default: "About" }}
      </span>

      {%- comment -%} Gold Divider {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="kc-reveal kc-reveal--delay-1" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div class="kc-divider" style="width: 60px;"></div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Headline {%- endcomment -%}
      <h2
        class="kc-reveal kc-reveal--delay-2"
        style="
          font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
          font-weight: 900;
          font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
          letter-spacing: -0.02em;
          line-height: 1.1;
          color: #ffffff;
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
        "
      >
        {{ section.settings.headline | default: "G'day, I'm Just Some Bloke" }}
        <span class="kc-gold-text">
          {{ section.settings.headline_gold | default: "Who Figured Some Shit Out." }}
        </span>
      </h2>

      {%- comment -%} Body Paragraphs {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign delay = 3 -%}
      {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
        {%- assign para_key = 'paragraph_' | append: i -%}
        {%- if section.settings[para_key] != blank -%}
          <p
            class="kc-reveal kc-reveal--delay-{{ delay }}"
            style="
              font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
              font-weight: 400;
              font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.05rem);
              line-height: 1.85;
              color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
              margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            "
          >
            {{ section.settings[para_key] }}
          </p>
          {%- assign delay = delay | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}

      {%- comment -%} Gold Blockquote {%- endcomment -%}
      <p
        class="kc-reveal kc-reveal--delay-{{ delay }}"
        style="
          font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
          font-weight: 600;
          font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.05rem);
          line-height: 1.8;
          color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
          margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
          border-left: 3px solid rgba(212,168,83,0.5);
          padding-left: 1.25rem;
        "
      >
        {{ section.settings.blockquote | default: "I'm not a doctor, and this isn't a magic bullet. But if you're tired of feeling stuck and ready to build something better, you're in the right place." }}
      </p>

      {%- comment -%} CTA Button {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign cta_delay = delay | plus: 1 -%}
      <div class="kc-reveal kc-reveal--delay-{{ cta_delay }}">
        <a
          href="{{ section.settings.cta_url | default: '#offerings' }}"
          class="kc-btn-outline"
        >
          {{ section.settings.cta_label | default: "Read My Full Story" }}
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "KC About",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "kc-section-about",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "bg_image",
      "label": "Background Image",
      "info": "Recommended: kc-about-bg.jpg — lone hiker at golden sunrise"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow Label",
      "default": "About"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "headline",
      "label": "Headline (white portion)",
      "default": "G'day, I'm Just Some Bloke"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "headline_gold",
      "label": "Headline (gold gradient portion)",
      "default": "Who Figured Some Shit Out."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_1",
      "label": "Paragraph 1",
      "default": "Look, I'm not going to start this off with a bunch of fancy credentials or tell you I'm some sort of guru who's got it all figured out. Truth is, I'm just an average bloke who's seen some shit, done some shit, and somehow managed to get over some shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_2",
      "label": "Paragraph 2",
      "default": "I've been through the wringer with ADHD, PTSD, depression, and anxiety. I know what it's like to wake up and feel like your brain is trying to sabotage you. I spent years trying everything — therapy, medication, self-help books that made me want to punch something — and most of it felt like pissing in the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_3",
      "label": "Paragraph 3",
      "default": "But slowly, I started to figure out what actually worked. Not just what the clinical textbooks said should work, but what made a difference in the trenches of day-to-day life."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "paragraph_4",
      "label": "Paragraph 4",
      "default": "That's what The KC Theory is. It's not academic nonsense. It's a practical toolkit built on three simple things: Commitment to doing the work, Consistency in your efforts, and Compassion for yourself when you inevitably stuff up."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "blockquote",
      "label": "Gold Blockquote",
      "default": "I'm not a doctor, and this isn't a magic bullet. But if you're tired of feeling stuck and ready to build something better, you're in the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "CTA Button Label",
      "default": "Read My Full Story"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_url",
      "label": "CTA Button URL"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "KC About"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
